520
00:46:11.573 --> 00:46:14.120
Uh, yeah.

521
00:46:21.082 --> 00:46:24.004
Julie, no one ever said
that bed rest would be easy.

522
00:46:24.486 --> 00:46:27.477
And more often, than not
